{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-11_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-11",
  "title": "使徒",
  "storyCode": "14-12",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-11_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3211991f9ddeca93f40c1a6b99f070bfa909da0a183e66e0122b1448e2ff7f6c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你在这里啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......临光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你难得回一趟本舰，不多陪陪丽兹吗？她很想你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "她刚睡着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "倒是你，看上去比以前更疲惫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "是在担心丽兹吗？我问过凯尔希医生，她说丽兹的病情还在可控范围内——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "是不是......有什么你们没告诉我的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我在想......彻底“治愈”丽兹的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你为这事已经花费了很多年了，不可能一蹴而就的。别太折磨自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "如果......我说方法一直在那里，只是我不敢触碰呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "......闪灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你到底藏了什么心事？难道连我都不能说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "临光，这是我自己需要面对的使命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "......你觉得我和丽兹会离开你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你明明很清楚，这是最不可能发生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我担心的......从来都是你们会受到伤害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我已经决定和丽兹一起找到回忆。我会陪伴她......直到真相揭晓的那一刻。但如果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "临光——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "在必要的时刻，我需要你替我保护丽兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "但我会保护的，会与之并肩作战的......不是只有丽兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵，我也会为你而战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我们从来都是同伴。使徒是一体的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我的誓言依旧不变——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "只要你们需要，玛嘉烈·临光还有她的剑枪，会随时为你们而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剑枪横扫。\n耀眼的光芒逼退了一众敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "这里的每一个赦罪师......都是强敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵，难怪你不愿意和我对战训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我们替罗德岛省了不少钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "最大的敌人......还在前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我们争取速战速决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "......儿戏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "唔——哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我能扛住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵，我的盾会掩护你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你只需要......前进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巫术的洪流涌向她们。\n玛嘉烈的光芒竟被压了下去。\n奎萨图什塔站在台阶最高处，掌心翻涌着晨昏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "这就是你找来的帮手吗？奎萨辛娜，你将我们的仪式现场当作什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "供马匹比赛取乐的......草原？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "呵，她的源石技艺竟能暂时阻隔我对你的影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "那又如何呢？你的剑术，你的源石技艺，全部都来自我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "没有我的允许，你怎么可能......伤到我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "咳咳——呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "变慢了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "他的法术......作用于时间感知？还是别的影响......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你的盾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "......这面新盾牌还是第一次出现裂痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "不过没关系，我会用源石技艺补上缺口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "在需要保护的人身前，骑士的盾不会这么脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "......令人厌恶的光芒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "小马驹，像你这样的天马......我过去杀死过不知多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我把他们金色的血抹在我那座卡兹戴尔的城墙上——让我的城市看起来永远都沐浴在黎明的光辉中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "这样的话，他们的后代就会明白，卡兹戴尔不是可以肆意侵犯的领地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "......这可不是在卡兹戴尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "你也不是什么保家卫国的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "英雄流自己的血，为其他人开道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "而你——我只见到，你登上王座的道路上，铺满他人的血泪与尸骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "英雄？我早就不想做什么英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "人人传唱，人人敬仰......却依旧如沙土般易逝。不管我怎么舞弄光阴，时间都不会为我停驻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "我会死去，我建立的城市会崩塌。我所爱着的子民，也不得不继续流离失所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "这无望的循环......折磨着每一个萨卡兹，也折磨着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "可我身为君主，我有责任，有能力，理应从源头处改变萨卡兹的命运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "只要能令萨卡兹不再匍匐于你们这些野兽的脚下，只要能令我的卡兹戴尔在无数个晨昏中永存不灭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伴随着奎萨图什塔的话语，周围全部的光都在朝他掌心涌去。\n玛嘉烈的源石技艺，其他赦罪师的法术光辉，以及......被浓厚云层过滤的，仅剩的日光。\n悬在他掌心的那顶小小的荆棘冠冕，就像一片不容置喙的黑夜。\n石床上的夜莺也跟着浮了起来。\n她依然眼睛紧闭，四肢无力，双臂却不由自主地张开——\n等到最后一片光也被囚禁的那一刻，冠冕就会落到奎萨图什塔的头顶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "丽兹......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵，沿着我的光！去救她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "最后一抹锐利的光如同投枪，撕开一路的巫术屏障。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闪灵来到奎萨图什塔身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑夜如囚笼般降临，唯一的光，来自她的剑。\n那是在剑锋上停驻的，灵魂之火闪烁的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......丽兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我把曾被我夺走的，最真实的记忆还给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "因为我探索灵魂的执念......我没有抹除雕刻你时留下的那些——不必要的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你......苏醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你开始拥有情感，有所回应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "实验仍在继续，我不得不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我想，你至少会好受一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你会感觉到，自己是真实活着的，也曾拥有过......一点温暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你早就该想起来了......丽兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你一定记得，我们全部的约定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蓝色的羽兽在黑暗中浮现。\n巨大的灰白色眼球注视着闪灵，缓缓落下一滴眼泪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半空中的人缓缓地下坠。\n在凝滞的时间中，闪灵和玛嘉烈同时听到了夜莺的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我记得的，闪灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你带着我一路从最黑的房间里逃出去......陪伴着我四处求医......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "然后我们遇到了临光，我们三个人一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我们去了很多地方，救了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你常常在半夜皱眉叹气......但只要我睁开眼睛，你就会换上最温柔的语调，跟我说一路上我错过的美好的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "临光好几次试着教我跳舞，拉着我转呀转......我转不动了，你们就会一起搀着我......轮流背我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "在你们身边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我仿佛......真的会飞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你们一起，让我成为了现在的我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我是使徒的一员......一名医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我也会保护你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我也会，与你们并肩作战，斩断最深的罪孽，拯救......将被永恒黑夜笼罩的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "这是我们三个人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "......约定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜莺落到了地面上。\n极致的光芒自她的法杖中、身体里释放。\n巨大的囚笼显现，反过来将奎萨图什塔的身躯捕捉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "明明灵魂完全在我手中，这囚笼为何——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我有名字的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我叫丽兹，是你的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "奎萨图什塔，我阻止你......是因为你说的每一句话，我都不同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "闪灵、临光......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闪灵握紧了剑。\n玛嘉烈掷出了剑枪，枪尖正中奎萨图什塔手中旋转的荆棘冠冕。\n三人毫无差错地领悟了彼此心中所想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在晨昏再度被掌控之前，抓住那一线灵魂之火闪烁的微光。\n绵长血色的唯一一道裂缝，的确就在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我找到了，你灵魂的本质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "奎萨辛娜......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "这副身躯会变成什么样......我并不担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "如果我的意志会被血脉掌控，那丽兹和临光会替此刻的我，对我下达判决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "但我决不会成为你的傀儡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我不会替你去征服，去统治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "至死......我都一定是自由的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "自由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "那就试试看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "奎萨辛娜，我们不会轻易分离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "试试看，从我身边......再逃开一次。试试看......能逃多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我不会再逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我会——给予你唯一且永恒的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "闪灵——后退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "树梢上的月亮滚落悬崖，地面剧烈地晃动着，如同要上下颠倒一般。\n祭坛崩溃，金色的源石浆液涌出缺口。\n一个身影不知何时走来，没有人察觉到他的动作。他的速度并不快，却恰到好处地挡在了奎萨图什塔与使徒中间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "text": "该走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "text": "......殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奎萨图什塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_654_1",
      "text": "呵......竟然是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "什么人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "text": "使徒......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "text": "在这个勇气贫瘠的时代，你们的光芒，堪称夺目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1332_1",
      "text": "我们还会再见面的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀利喀和奎萨图什塔的身影没入祭坛的残骸中。\n其他赦罪师紧随其后。\n那顶被光枪击落的荆棘冠冕突然旋转起来，化作一道漆黑的虚影，往天空飞去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......碎片大厦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "那风暴中央的是......通讯中说的“阿喃那”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "凯尔希医生和博士他们......能赶上吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵，你......呃，没感觉有什么不对劲吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "这血脉诅咒确实很复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "等等，丽兹......丽兹？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "丽兹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你的灵魂......为什么不完整？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "你刚刚难道是以撕裂灵魂为代价......反抗了奎萨图什塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "闪灵......临光......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "我一直在的，丽兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我没关系的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "你们保护了我很久......这次，也可以换我来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜莺",
      "speakerId": "avg_179_cgbird_1",
      "text": "我......想和你们......永远......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "丽兹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "治疗，闪灵，我们一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "闪灵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "没用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "我们的源石技艺，在这样的环境下，没有办法弥合这么严重的灵魂创伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "丽兹从身体到灵魂，本就无比特殊。她诞生于一个巧合......不，我更愿意称它为奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "那我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "先离开这里，再计划下一步行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "奎萨图什塔呢，要放他离开？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "比起丽兹的安危，他的死活根本不值一提——他早已不再重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪灵",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_147_shining_1",
      "text": "走吧，我们回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "text": "嗯，我们一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "......首领。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "text": "（愤怒的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "奎萨图什塔囚禁黑冠的计划失败了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "祭坛的力量变弱了......我可以克服它的影响——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "祭坛上层已开始崩溃。阿米娅，集中攻击“提卡兹之血”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "唔......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "魔王已经宣判过我的死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "不过是，再来一次罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "你明明......很痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "你如此敬爱奎萨图什塔，可他这么轻易地抛下了你。他看待你，就和你看待那些奇美拉造物......没有区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "别费心了，“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "我的情感没什么特别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "赦罪师，本就全都是首领的血脉。不过有的天生拥有更完美的肉体......比如奎萨辛娜。还有的，比如我，从来不可能被选中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "但我从不嫉妒她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "我们只是，各自都在合适的位置上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "原本我们可以相亲相爱。我们互为手足......宛如一体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
      "text": "没有任何一个团体能像赦罪师一般，缔造前人未见的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你很执着。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......冥顽不灵。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "我也有自己好奇的事啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "难道你没有吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "“博士”......为了你一生的事业，为了你爱着的，与你一路奋战至此的人......你难道，不会做出和我一样的选择？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "是否被控制......是否被影响，都已经无关紧要了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "抵达原点，创造一个全新的未来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "这就是我想要的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "不能......让你靠近“提卡兹之血”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "哈......啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑色线条再次贯穿萨卢斯的身躯，同时刺穿了祭坛的中心。\n“提卡兹之血”凝滞了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "我明明已经很近了......呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "阿米娅，阻止她！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "她想引爆——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "npc_10002",
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "没关系......没关系。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "我的身体......就像怪物一样......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她将残破的手伸向那滴血红。\n一段只有赦罪师知道的咒言，基于灵魂，基于全部的血和肉——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "这一次，我大概会彻底死去吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "先于首领，先于奎萨辛娜，先于我所有的家人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萨卢斯",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_653_1",
          "text": "走进我所向往的......未来之中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "萨卢斯微笑着，扑向了那颗停滞的心脏。\n“提卡兹之血”沸腾了。\n巨大的赤红色漩涡出现在祭坛中心——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在那一瞬，阿米娅感到自己正被注视着。\n被奎萨图什塔，被无名的戴冠之人，被咆哮的众魂......还有她最熟悉的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "特蕾西娅小姐......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "“阿喃那”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "萨卢斯用自己的血完成了赦罪师的仪式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "快走，离开这个祭坛！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
